    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d928">

                <pb facs="0827" n="655" xml:id="pg655"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 124.55/12a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Belgium</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Whitlock</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-23T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 23, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>268. By direction of the President you are instructed to withdraw from Belgium at
                    once accompanied by the Legation staff, consular officers, and all American
                    members of the Commission for Relief in Belgium. Please telegraph Department
                    probable date of departure, route, and plans. You should take up your official
                    residence at Havre accompanied by your Legation staff.</p>
                <p>Before leaving you should carry out instructions contained in Department’s 248,
                    February 3, 5 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d928-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>This Government has approved the proposal of the Netherland Government to send
                    into Belgium a certain number of Netherland subjects to undertake the work thus
                    far carried on by the American staff.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
